  (text "USB-C pass-through daughterboard (break-off tab, mounted in the rear ADB cut-out)"
    (at 25.4 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 75ebebc9-3b63-4996-87d2-95311a0e3fa1)
  )
  (text "J3 faces outward through the case. R4/R5 (5.1k Rd) on CC1/CC2 make any USB-C host or\ncharger supply VBUS. J4 faces inward; a short off-the-shelf USB 2.0 C-to-C cable connects\nit to the nice!nano, which has its own Rd, so J4 CC1/CC2 stay open.\nDB_* nets exist only on this tab: the cable is the only connection to the main board,\nso the tab can be broken off without leaving unrouted nets."
    (at 25.4 137.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d6b63a6a-1083-439f-9fd4-3cffb9bc1222)
  )

